<import src="../../templates/status.wxml"/><view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">FITCREW · JOURNEY</view><view class="title">给改变一点时间</view><view class="subtitle">一段 90 天的旅程，由每天真实的记录组成。</view><template is="status" data="{{loading,error,busy}}"/><view class="card hero" wx:if="{{state.journey}}"><view class="pill">{{state.journey.days}} 天旅程</view><view class="h2">{{state.journey.title}}</view><view class="body">起点 {{state.journey.start_date}}</view></view><view class="card"><view class="h2">{{state.journey ? '调整旅程方向' : '你最想先照顾什么？'}}</view><picker range="{{goals}}" value="{{goalIndex}}" bindchange="select"><view class="input">{{goals[goalIndex]}} · 点击选择</view></picker><button class="primary" bindtap="save" disabled="{{busy || !state}}">保存方向</button><view class="small muted">进行中的实验需先停止，才能改变方向。</view></view><view class="card" wx:if="{{state}}"><view class="h2">旅程中的真实记录</view><view wx:if="{{!logs.length}}" class="muted">还没有记录，不推断趋势或进展。</view><view wx:for="{{logs}}" wx:key="id"><view class="divider"/><view class="small muted">{{item.created_at}}</view><view class="body">{{item.feeling}} · 精力 {{item.energy}} / 5</view></view></view></view>
